    {
      "type": "examAlert",
      "items": [
        "Order of Discontinuities (Surface to Center): Conrad (Crust), Mohorovičić (Crust-Mantle), Repetti (Upper-Lower Mantle), Gutenberg (Mantle-Core), Lehmann (Outer-Inner Core).",
        "P-wave shadow zone occurs between 103° and 142° from the epicenter, whereas the S-wave shadow zone extends continuously beyond 103°.",
        "The asthenosphere (upper mantle up to 400 km depth) is plastic/semi-fluid and serves as the main magma source during volcanic activity."
      ],
      "id": "lc933xp"
